        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 243.67,
          "end": 246.6,
          "en": "so we don't need a return value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 246.6,
          "end": 250.46,
          "en": "hence we can set void as an expected return value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 250.46,
          "end": 255.017,
          "en": "of this function, we get as a value on onAddTodo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 256.65,
          "end": 259.59,
          "en": "But, onAddTodo should be a function",
